WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.800
I suggested that I replace Zhou Yu

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:35.340
and compete with the mysterious masked chef

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.830
on cooking skills in

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:37.680
the Three-round Lobster Competition.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.720
Then I started the second round
of this competition with him.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:42.750
In this competition to see
who can make fried lobsters faster,

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:43.740
I won.

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:46.430
I must get the antidote

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:47.780
for Meili and Zhou Yu

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.450
as soon as possible.

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:50.600
Otherwise, they'll die.

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:52.530
I'm running out of time.

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.160
The Greatest Trump Card! The Mocking Joker

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.010
The third round of the Three-round Lobster Competition.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:16.300
What's the theme this time?

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:18.000
Knife skills.

00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:23.330
Frying. That is frying lobsters.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:24.230
After the two themes,

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:25.920
the third theme

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:28.140
can be said to be one of the most difficult

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:29.780
cooking skills.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.030
Stewing.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:32.910
That is the pot dish.

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:36.090
The pot dish?

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.450
There is no limit on this round

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:40.000
as long as you use lobsters

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.360
to make a one-pot dish.

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:43.670
The winner is the one whose dish

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:44.260
tastes better.

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:47.110
But during the competition,

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.460
the blood of the blood timer will still drop.

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:56.380
If you're too slow,

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:57.960
the toxin will spread to their whole body.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:02:59.730
Zhou Yu and his daughter

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:00.760
will die by then.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.740
Crap. This guy is too...

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:13.150
I was too careless before.

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:14.930
Looks like if I don’t get serious about

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:16.160
dealing with you,

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:18.450
I'm afraid that

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:19.460
my revenge plan will be ruined by you.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:24.920
Kid, choose the ingredients

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:26.800
you need at will.

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:43.400
This is...

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.330
In this ingredient bank,

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.140
the core is all kinds of delicacies from land and sea.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:54.680
All ingredients of the world are stored here.

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:57.960
If you lose in the situation where you have

00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:59.610
so many ingredients to choose from,

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:03.850
it'll imply that the reason why you lose

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:05.310
is just that your skills are worse than mine.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.380
You won't find an excuse by then,

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:07.940
kid.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:09.720
I don't need to find any excuses.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.440
Anyway, I have to win.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.040
Hey, bring it here.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:19.040
I got it.

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:23.760
The time is running out.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:24.920
I have to hurry up.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.000
What's inside those earthen jars?

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.260
These are the treasures that have absorbed my hatred.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:16.600
These are

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:17.810
dried foods.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:20.190
(Dried Foods)

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:22.140
Yes.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.580
These are dried foods that are made of

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.170
air-dried ingredients including abalones,

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.370
shark fins and sea fans. They can be stored.

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.000
It's not just for storing them.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:32.270
After soaking them completely,

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:34.440
their taste will be stronger than before.

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:36.370
These are special advanced Chinese ingredients.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:38.720
Are you going to use them?

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:39.920
Yes.

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:41.260
These dried foods

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.290
are ingredients that I didn’t get to use

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:45.330
that year because of Zhou Yu's scheme.

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:47.810
In other words, they're foods of 16 years ago.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:50.430
Don't talk about something like schemes

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:51.720
or revenge!

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:53.230
Zhou Yu will never

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:54.760
use a scheme to hurt others.

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:55.920
Shut up, kid!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:57.780
It's just that you don't know it.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.550
You don't know

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:02.250
how contemptible Zhou Yu is.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:09.710
Sixteen years ago,

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.630
I fell in love with a girl.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:14.930
Her name is Meixiang.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.150
Meixiang,

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:17.740
please bring us two dishes of fried rice.

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:19.770
OK. I got it.

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:21.790
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:24.000
Meixiang is the only daughter of the owner

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:25.380
of the restaurant where I learned cooking.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:26.570
She's elegant

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.720
and she's a famous beauty in the town.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:31.520
She's the reason

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:32.870
I cook dishes.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:36.860
She's also the only reason I live.

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:39.500
Food for thirty people?

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:40.300
Yes.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.230
Because a group suddenly came here.

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:43.600
Can you handle it?

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.490
Yes, I'll handle it.

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:47.120
Don't worry. Leave it to me.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:48.590
Really?

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:49.700
Great!

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.180
For her smile,

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.750
I'm willing to do anything including dying.

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:13.660
However, one day,

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:15.930
the owner suddenly decided to hold a

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:17.980
cooking competition for picking a husband for Meixiang.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.240
The person who stopped me

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.690
was Zhou Yu who had the same teacher as me.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:26.870
As chefs, we encouraged each other

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:28.700
and competed with each other in our daily life.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:30.600
I didn't expect that

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:32.250
I would have a competition with you.

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.410
But you're qualified to be my opponent.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:35.960
Let's compete against each other

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:36.900
in an aboveboard competition.

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:38.150
I'm willing to compete with you.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:47.740
This so-called intense competition of

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:49.930
the two students who had the same teacher

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.590
attracted a lot of people that day.

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:55.380
At that time, the theme of the competition was...

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:58.730
Let's start the Three-round Lobster Competition, Zhou Yu.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:07:59.700
OK.

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:01.290
Miss Meixiang,

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:03.870
I'll win

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:06.810
and make you live a happy life.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.860
Well, the competition has officially started.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.660
However, soon after the competition started,

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:17.100
something bad happened.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:23.140
This is...

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.910
Zhou Yu, you're a jerk.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.180
Zhou Yu was so contemptible

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.000
that he put a poisonous needle in my lobsters.

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:34.230
I couldn't forgive him anyway,

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:36.280
so I didn't tell others about it.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:37.750
I just tried to stand up.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:39.460
As a chef,

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:40.750
I kept competing against him

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:41.910
with the will to defeat him.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:44.550
Let's fight, Zhou Yu.

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:54.090
However, I lost both

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:55.150
the first and the second rounds.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:57.720
Before I had a chance to

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:58.760
take out those dried foods I specially prepared

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.250
for the third round,

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:03.890
Zhou Yu was chosen to be the fiancé of Meixiang.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:07.810
With his despicable scheme,

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.090
I lost the competition like that

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:13.270
and I also lost Meixiang in public.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.840
To be honest,

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:21.270
my enthusiasm for cooking

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.740
was the enthusiasm for Meixiang.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:24.830
Because of Zhou Yu's scheme,

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:26.000
I lost the competition

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:27.650
and I also lost

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.110
the meaning of my cooking career.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:49.780
After that,

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.150
I abandoned everything of my past

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:54.770
and sealed myself by putting on

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:55.680
a mask and a body armor.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:57.750
Later,

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:01.270
I gave myself up and joined the Dark Cooking Society.

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:03.800
I swore revenge on Zhou Yu one day.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:05.690
The Dark Cooking Society?

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.730
You don't have to know about it.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:10.650
Anyway, after you lose,

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:12.010
you'll have to drink that bottle of poison

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:13.230
and die with them.

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:15.690
I will never lose.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.330
No matter what you say,

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.200
I always believe Zhou Yu.

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:24.930
How can a kid like you understand

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.980
the torture I had suffered for over a decade?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:29.470
But

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:32.050
it seems that everything's worth it.

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:35.880
Because of the torture for so many years,

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:39.320
those dried foods became more and more mature.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:41.520
Their special tastes increased day by day.

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.350
That means

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:45.150
they're the most suitable top dried foods

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:46.650
to be used on the day of revenge.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:48.690
I'll use them

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.270
to make the top pot dish
that I had no chance to make that year

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:52.440
and defeat you completely.

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:58.190
This is the last movement of my revenge plan.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:10:59.360
The finale to

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:10.920
the Three-round Lobster Competition.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.200
The decisive third round and also the last round

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:14.870
is going to start, kid.

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:15.580
OK.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:25.970
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:34.560
This is also good.

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:37.780
No, I think I'd better use this.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.070
The masked chef is going to make a seafood pot.

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:42.970
Well,

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:48.960
I’ll also use those fresh fish and shrimp.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.130
No, I can't.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.600
No matter what fresh ingredients I use,

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:57.540
the dish I make can't be better than

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:58.960
the tasty mellow stock with dried foods

00:11:59.010 --> 00:11:59.930
which have been stored for over ten years.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.720
What pot dish on earth

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:04.720
should I make?

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:16.290
The key to the pot dish

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:17.500
is the stock.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:20.740
Make the tasty mellow stock

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:22.140
with so many top dried foods.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.300
The taste which has accumulated

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:25.320
for more than ten years

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:26.650
will never lose.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:31.380
What should I do? I'm running out of time.

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:50.560
I have a splitting headache!

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.890
What on earth should I do?

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.450
It hurts so badly.

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:01.990
Fei.

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:05.690
Where is the origin of your cooking?

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:09.030
When you are puzzled,

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.870
go back to the origin.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:13.400
Yes.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:15.550
Just as what Fei taught me

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:17.370
in the Super Chef Test,

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.340
I should return to the origin now.

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:21.810
The origins of my cooking

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:23.820
are the flavors of my mother's dishes

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.920
and my hometown Sichuan.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:43.570
Right.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:44.520
Good.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.770
I decided to make this dish.

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:52.470
I'll use it to win.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:01.170
Cooking should make people happy.

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:02.670
No matter what the reason is,

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:04.320
I can't forgive someone who

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:05.470
considers cooking as a tool for revenge.

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:14.030
I got it.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.100
He decided to use wild vegetables from the mountain

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:17.850
which is called the \"stock treasury\".

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:20.480
Kid, you're amazing.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:21.580
But

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:32.440
in the limited time,

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:34.300
you have a fatal disadvantage.

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:39.660
OK. I've processed all the ingredients.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:01.500
Kid, I'd like to remind you.

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:04.130
I think it's time to lift your pot lid

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.440
and take a look.

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:18.070
You're too careless, kid.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.460
It's true that you can use shiitake mushrooms,

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.770
yams and burdock roots to make a delicious stock.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.800
But if you put those wild vegetables

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:25.900
in the pot and boil them together,

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:26.710
a lot of impurities

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:28.330
will appear constantly as you can see.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:32.020
Once there are impurities,

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.500
the taste is ruined.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.480
Even if you try your best to get them out,

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:39.450
you can't get all of them out within the limited time.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:42.090
It's such a pity, kid.

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:49.480
I grew up in the mountains of Sichuan.

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.460
I've already prepared for the issue of impurities.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:52.130
What?

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.270
It's just my first step.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:05.220
We both know that's not true.

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:09.310
There will be lots of impurities in that kid's pot dish.

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:11.540
And the taste of the lobster which is the core of the dish

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:12.550
will change for it.

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:15.070
I'll use it to win!

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:23.160
Pot Dish Recipes.

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:25.870
It's a cookbook, right?

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.530
You're going to read this book now?

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:31.620
Although you have the title of \"Super Chef\",

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.480
you're still a child.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.540
What on earth does he want to do?

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:50.620
Before, you said that

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:52.310
you'll be serious this time, right?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.150
Then I'll also show you

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.050
my real competence.

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.030
Real competence?

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:01.680
Haven't you tried your best?

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.220
You're so boring.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.600
You're just bluffing.

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:06.800
I chose top dried foods

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:07.670
to make the stock.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.350
I have this stock. How can I lose?

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:17.000
Don't look down on me, kid.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:34.140
I'm done!

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.100
I used top dried foods to make

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:45.450
this seafood pot dish with the incredible stock.

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:48.130
It's called the Sea Dragon Pot.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.700
I'm also done.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.000
The Golconda Flying Dragon Pot

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:00.100
which is made of many precious wild vegetables

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:01.890
and specially made by Liu Maoxing.

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:07.700
What is the Golconda Flying Dragon Pot?

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:09.920
It's impossible.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:11.970
All of those impurities are gone.

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:13.200
How could he

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:13.740
remove all the impurities

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:14.670
in such a short time?

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:18.290
I think the lobsters have absorbed them.

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:30.900
Hurry up. Start judging the dishes.

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:31.980
Take your time.

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:37.220
The time is running out.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:38.290
After all the blood of the blood timer drops,

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:39.520
all of them will die.

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:40.990
Judge the dishes now!

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:42.510
Take your time, kid.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:44.150
I've got a judge

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.230
who's suitable for

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:46.280
this decisive round.

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:08.000
Silang, why are you here?

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:10.340
I wanted to meet you,

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:11.920
but I was caught.

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.880
Stop! Don't resort to violence!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:20.530
It hurts so badly.

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:25.280
You bastards! It really hurts so badly!

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:26.640
I hate you!

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:27.340
Silang!

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:30.240
Mao, I'm sorry.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:31.930
I was worried about you,

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.240
so I came here alone.

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.330
However, I was caught.

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:38.910
Zhou Yu. Meili.

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:40.940
Mao, they...

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:43.890
They were both poisoned by this masked chef.

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:45.360
What? Poison?

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:47.680
Bastard, how dare you do that to them?

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:50.870
Let me go! Let me go now!

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:52.300
Silang!

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:54.820
Are you okay, Silang?

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:56.790
I'm fine.

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.480
What on earth do you mean?

00:19:58.620 --> 00:19:59.830
Are you going to let another irrelevant person

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:00.690
get involved in this?

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.280
Is the judge you meant...

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:07.360
Yes.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:09.570
Let's appoint him as the judge.

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:11.260
But we can't tell him anything

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.280
about the pot dishes we cooked.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.230
After he tastes our dishes,

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.300
he needs to pick the dish which is more delicious.

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:18.040
I'll be the judge?

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:19.480
Yes.

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:22.060
If you pick the dish made by Mao,

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:23.640
everyone will be saved.

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:24.670
But

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:26.860
if you pick the dish made by me,

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.670
Zhou Yu, Meili and others will die.

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:29.900
And Mao,

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:32.210
you're also going to die with them.

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:34.980
Hey, wait a minute.

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:36.920
Are you kidding me?

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:38.120
My judgment

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:40.060
is related to everyone's life?

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:43.220
I can't take on such great responsibilities.

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:48.190
Hurry up! Three-round Lobster Competition.

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:50.110
In the decisive third round,

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:53.110
is the dish of the white pot more delicious
or that of the black pot more delicious?

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:55.000
Make a decision now.

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:04.990
You're lying, right?

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:06.980
No kidding.

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:08.840
What are you thinking about?

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:12.640
My judgment is related to everyone's life.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:17.400
Silang, hurry up.

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:18.620
We're running out of time.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:21.980
M- Mao, it's easy for you to say that.

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:26.230
Is it the pot dish made of seafood?

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:28.640
The smell of the sea is really fascinating.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:30.710
And this pot dish

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:32.380
is made of wild vegetables.

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:35.560
The combination of wild vegetables from the mountain
and the lobsters from the sea

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:36.610
is also good.

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:39.270
Both dishes are great.

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:40.590
Which one...

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:43.350
Which one is made by Mao?

00:23:14.976 --> 00:23:16.979
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.605 --> 00:23:22.067
What a jerk, I can't believe you dragged Silang into this.

00:23:22.192 --> 00:23:23.277
I'm counting on you, Silang.

00:23:23.359 --> 00:23:26.070
Everyone's life is conting on your tongue.

00:23:26.571 --> 00:23:28.448
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.531 --> 00:23:31.701
Heroism! Grand Finale of Revenge!

00:23:31.743 --> 00:23:33.412
It will definitely be interesting!
